  "worked_solution": "First, we drop the parentheses and the addition sign, which gives\n\n$$\n4.7+(-2.5)=4.7-2.5.\n$$\n\nThen, we carry out the subtraction as usual. This gives\n\n$$\n4.7-2.5=2.2.\n$$",
